# Segfault March: a Bellbeat song, our own.
# In 2/4: eight sixteenths a bar, left, right.

title  Segfault March
blurb  Step out of bounds and the whole band keeps marching.
bpm    120
meter  2
voice  bell
order  intro verse chorus verse chorus outro

